{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:ede275f9153bd856","name":"Radiation Shielding","source":{"id":"source:reference-ede275f9153bd856","title":"Radiation Shielding","revision":19740,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:31:32Z","sha256":"6be9f7dea859d5844d7191b44f450749fa38f306e9f6719daacb09d41dce650c","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19740","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Radiation%20Shielding&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-ede275f9153bd856","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 400\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Upgrade Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Upgrade_Point"}," Cost:"]}," 1\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Radiation Shielding is necessary heavy and bulky. Only a suit of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Medium Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Medium_Armor","referenceId":"reference:e2a45d7d144d40dd"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heavy Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heavy_Armor","referenceId":"reference:4bc2d20a5687b54f"}," can be modified with Radiation Shielding, and it increases the Armor's weight by 10 kg. The Radiation Shielding grants a +10 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," bonus to a wearer's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"}," against ",{"tag":"a","children":["Radiation"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Radiation","referenceId":"reference:669c428e617d7f09"}," attacks, and it reduces any damage dealt by a successful ",{"tag":"a","children":["Radiation"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Radiation","referenceId":"reference:669c428e617d7f09"}," attack by 5 points.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["In addition, any time you would move -1 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persistent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persistent"}," step down the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"}," as a result of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Radiation"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Radiation","referenceId":"reference:669c428e617d7f09"}," damage while wearing this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"},", you can make a DC 20 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Endurance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Endurance","referenceId":"reference:98c8abf84e23ff3f"}," check to negate the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persistent Condition"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persistent_Condition"},". You can make this check only the first time you move down the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"}," due to a particular ",{"tag":"a","children":["Radiation"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Radiation","referenceId":"reference:669c428e617d7f09"}," Hazard; if you fail, you must have the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persistent Condition"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persistent_Condition"}," cured normal (see ",{"tag":"a","children":["Treat Radiation"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Treat_Radiation"},").\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
